From b07d1b2267aaa24fc0855bb05bc713a6c2f5defa Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jakub Skokan <jakub.skokan@havefun.cz>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 22:41:18 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 03/13] portal: add authorized file downloads and source copy
 actions

Let workspace file anchors open in a new tab and copy complete source
previews without line numbers. Reuse the source resolver for bounded raw
attachment downloads, including binary and preview-limited content.

Downloads retain Git eligibility, confinement and archived final-object
resolution. The new endpoints are additive and capped at 10 MiB.
