From: Jakub Skokan <jakub.skokan@havefun.cz>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 22:41:29 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 04/13] portal: keep large artifact catalogs compact and stable

Group artifact filenames under native directory disclosures and let the
navigation and preview scroll independently. Keep selection, open folders
and navigation position across status refreshes.

Copy raw text or Markdown from the preview response. Bind asynchronous
preview results and actions to a selection generation so stale requests
cannot replace the current file or copy target.
