From f8f2938b4e2cfd6e5b82657d08f014357817808f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jakub Skokan <jakub.skokan@havefun.cz>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 23:56:43 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 08/13] portal: show delivery recovery beside the composer

Show Send and Queue failures inline while retaining the original attempt
and confirmed receipts after response loss. Keep the compact dismissal X
bound to its existing durable presentation semantics. Clear a failure
notice only after acceptance or transcript proof for the same conversation,
thread, attempt and action, retaining unrelated warnings and newer drafts.

Cover response loss with disposable HTTP fixtures and grow the combined
browser acceptance fixture with same-ID retry and receipt assertions.
No transport retry or durable state format changes are introduced.
