From: Jakub Skokan <jakub.skokan@havefun.cz>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 18:12:41 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 09/13] portal: browse eligible session files in a lazy tree

The Files tab lists tracking files under the same Git eligibility and
explicit-publication rules as the source viewer. Load it only on first
open or Refresh, preserve the last good tree on failure, and open native
source links in a new tab instead of maintaining a second preview UI.

Resolve retained own-session artifact prefixes only after a missing
literal file and an existing confined suffix. Keep literal nested files
separate and preserve legacy publication routes and manifest formats.
