From 76ff90090b70e89904b4faebc8b422ac9764f793 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jakub Skokan <jakub.skokan@havefun.cz>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 18:26:09 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 10/13] portal: retire paused read cycles and recover on tab
 resume

Release canceled read slots immediately so a resumed document starts fresh
without waiting for an old transport. Apply data, errors and finalizers
only to their current cycle. Keep deadline failures visible and propagate
JSON body failures instead of accepting empty successful snapshots.

Coalesce provider catalogs, pause hidden attention and storage polling,
and preserve genuine stale team observations until fresh evidence arrives.
Consume the optional pending invalidation bridge without advertising it for
legacy clients, and bound ordinary hints by successful pending freshness.
Durable sends, provider changes and notification enablement keep their
existing mutation and recovery contracts.
